# Gemini models

- Default text LLM: `gemini-3.6-flash` (env `GEMINI_MODEL` overrides).
- Do **not** default to `gemini-2.5-flash` or `gemini-2.5-flash-lite` — Google shut those for new API keys; use 3.x Flash instead.
- TTS may still use a separate `GEMINI_TTS_MODEL` (preview TTS id); only change that if Google documents a replacement.
